        <definition>const uint64_t llvm::mca::DefaultResourceStrategy::ResourceUnitMask</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>ResourceUnitMask</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::mca::DefaultResourceStrategy::ResourceUnitMask</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A Mask of resource unit identifiers. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>There is one bit set for every available resource unit. It defaults to the value of field ResourceSizeMask in <ref refid="classllvm_1_1mca_1_1_resource_state" kindref="compound">ResourceState</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
